# tools.git — the w1ld0s companion toolkit: target/attack state, enumeration
# wrappers, payload helpers, offline cheatsheets, and the aliases file that
# module 00 wires into ~/.zshrc. Consumed by modules/90-tools.sh.
#
# https, not git@: this must clone on a box with no SSH key and no GitHub
# account. Override with $W1LD0S_TOOLS_REPO to point a fork somewhere else.
